        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 122029KR/7 Decorative Floral Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nAssembled in the USA by First Impressions, this 7\" decorative flower design cabinet handle is available in 6 different finishes to compliment  your cabinet doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: With out the Flower Roses <a href=\"/products/flower-cabinet-handle-first-impressions-1220-7\"><b>First Impressions 1220/7 7\" Floral Cabinet Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe highly detailed floral design is impeccably crafted from solid forged brass. The decorator's choice for decorative cabinet hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe floral design matches First Impressions <a href=\"/products/decorative-floral-cabinet-knob-set-first-impressions-1229k-1229kr\"><b>1229K/1229KR Floral Cabinet Knob Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/17-inch-castle-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-svy875017sbr\"><b>1229/1/17 Refrigerator Door Pull</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 122029KR/7 Floral Cabinet Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4-1/4\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Rosette Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
